  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ukraine: Help Children&apos;s Hospitals to Save Lives</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">War crimes are being committed in Ukraine as hospitals are attacked, and citizens are displaced. Half of Ukraine&apos;s power grid is crippled, causing prolonged nationwide power and water outages. As a result, healthcare professionals are struggling in tough conditions. This, combined with massive state underfinancing, means that hospitals are desperate for help. We provide essential medical tools, supplies, and life-saving equipment to ensure effective medical care for children.</narrative>
  </description>
